        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Alright I'm good for now.Thanks for the Pony.(PS - my Birthday is in 3 weeks, and my favorite color is a 1962 Corvette in silver with Burgandy interior.)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3b42f06ebb66196c47c45527a478000f087b8ca3.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/3b42f06ebb66196c47c45527a478000f087b8ca3\" title=\"http://paintref.com/graphics/sample/corvette1962WA2815.jpg\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3b42f06ebb66196c47c45527a478000f087b8ca3_2_690x440.jpeg\" alt=\"http://paintref.com/graphics/sample/corvette1962WA2815.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"8sfApC93H75PoWvUb5e2Y6MpQT9\" width=\"690\" height=\"440\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3b42f06ebb66196c47c45527a478000f087b8ca3_2_690x440.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3b42f06ebb66196c47c45527a478000f087b8ca3.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3b42f06ebb66196c47c45527a478000f087b8ca3.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"6E6E61\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">http://paintref.com/graphics/sample/corvette1962WA2815.jpg</span><span class=\"informations\">800×511 129 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></